      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e EXPORT_TRACEPOINT_SYMBOL_GPL(binder_txn_latency_free);\n\nwhy would that be needed?\n\n\u003e trace_binder_txn_latency_free_enabled do I need to implement too?\n\nthe `trace_binder_txn_latency_free()` tracepoint is in `binder_txn_latency_free()`. Instead of your new hook, your vendor module should attach to that tracepoint (which will cause `trace_binder_txn_latency_free_enabled()` to return true). Then you can free your memory inside your `trace_binder_txn_latency_free()` handkler.",
      "parentUuid": "8a00d1d1_ca5de0be",
